ship between spatial characteristics/scale and ED utilization, not a lack of relationship. It does not support the claim that there is \\"no\\" causal or associational link."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': "'Acute care demand leading to an ED visit' does not cause 'Spatial Scale' to change, nor does 'Spatial Scale' cause changes in acute care demand leading to an ED visit. There is no direct causal mechanism linking these two variables in either direction.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.0867574755274059, 'mean_token_prob': 0.9345697653492172, 'min_prob': 0.3204802314863805, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0016826188431413517, 'prob_variance': 0.01857432430026168, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.6627572025862327, 'avg_nll': 0.08319846965528957}

