r mechanisms linking 'Chronic addiction' and 'Incorrect use of medication.' Without clear definitions or evidence of a causal pathway, no direct causal relationship can be established.", 'aggregate_score': 0.2, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.3227630454243469, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8241775124309052, 'min_prob': 0.040931069062819396, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0007313515234739884, 'prob_variance': 0.05812007032098562, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.8913525926868985, 'avg_nll': 0.2797227651041399}

