esentations rather than the claim that no causal relationship can be established or that the variables lack definition. The cited source does not support the \\"NONE\\" relationship or the argument about undefined variables/measurements."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': "Cognitive disorder does not cause acute care demand leading to an ED visit in this context, as both variables are defined as 'None' and lack specified meaning or measurement. Without definitions or mechanisms, no causal relationship can be established in either direction.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.3268551451482122, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8330985838594378, 'min_prob': 0.022102972217925478, 'token_prob_slope': -0.004160634511646908, 'prob_variance': 0.05864526930042639, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0068964065560084, 'avg_nll': 0.2828115897445577}

