 supported"}', 'motivation': 'Frailty does not cause Time, nor does Time cause Frailty, as there is no direct causal mechanism linking these variables based on the provided definitions. Without a clear operational definition or context for either variable, no causal relationship can be established.', 'aggregate_score': 0.2, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.3966492760054194, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8095697794150765, 'min_prob': 0.05204017514705462, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005038163600915084, 'prob_variance': 0.0728658581702228, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0596960740166876, 'avg_nll': 0.33407599364098317}

