ted"}', 'motivation': "'Functioning of healthcare professionals' does not directly cause 'Mental disorder', nor does 'Mental disorder' directly cause 'Functioning of healthcare professionals'. There is no established direct causal mechanism from one to the other, and any potential relationship would likely be mediated by other factors such as quality of care or patient outcomes. Therefore, there is no direct causal relationship between these variables in either direction.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.3281239972040173, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8475263720755077, 'min_prob': 0.027259840651360546, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0022475445936312646, 'prob_variance': 0.06774368534870605, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.1889140546460586, 'avg_nll': 0.28376741808397254}

