   Properties: {'session_id': '5a6a1fdb-cfa9-443e-bcbf-9e21e27ffde7', 'prob_std': 0.25591921606844337, 'citations': ['https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK210048/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10797235/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4992501/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10582946/', 'https://careskillstraining.org/blog/what-is-informal-care-in-health-and-social-care/'], 'max_prob_diff': 0.7412389583604574, 'judge_message': '{"citations": [{"citation_idx": 1, "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK210048/", "verdict": "UNADDRESSED", "score": 0.0, "reason": "Judge 1: UNADDRESSED - The cited chapter extensively defines \\"informal caregivers,\\" describes their roles, tasks, and interactions with health professionals, and discusses the formal health care workforce (shortage of nurses, coordination with providers). Therefore the sources do provide definitions and context linking informal care to \\"personnel\\"/formal health personnel; they do not support the claim that no information exists to assess a relationship."}, {"citation_idx": 2, "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10797235/", "verdict": "UNADDRESSED", "score": 0.0, "reason": "Judge 1: UNADDRESSED - The cited article explicitly discusses the relationship between informal caregivers and healthcare professionals (e.g., \\"professionals may take on caregiving roles,\\" \\"mechanisms ... for rapid and effective training and support of informal caregivers,\\" the need for a \\"professional attitude\\" to integrate informal care), and cites studies and policy reports on integration of informal and formal care. Therefore the claim that \\"there is no information ... about how they might causally interact\\" is contradicted by the sources, which describe interactions, roles, and integration between informal care and health personnel."}, {"citation_idx": 3, "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4992501/", "verdict": "UNADDRESSED", "score": 0.0, "