h a direct causal link does or does not exist. Therefore the citation does not support the claim that there is no direct causal relationship between those two variables."}], "aggregate_score": 0.2, "aggregate_verdict": "Partially supported"}', 'motivation': 'Functioning of healthcare professionals does not cause 24/7-care mentality, nor does 24/7-care mentality cause functioning of healthcare professionals in a direct causal manner. There is no established mechanism by which changes in the functioning of healthcare professionals directly alter the broader 24/7-care mentality, or vice versa. Any association would likely be mediated by organizational culture or policies, not a direct causal link.', 'aggregate_score': 0.2, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'perplexity': 1.4195779000780044, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8124573279498337, 'min_prob': 0.00864036589149019, 'token_prob_slope': -0.004212045993885256, 'prob_variance': 0.07645530568029306, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.1454085447753433, 'avg_nll': 0.3503595739584067}

