ctioning."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': "Health literacy does not directly cause functioning of healthcare professionals. While health literacy may influence patient behaviors or outcomes, any effect on healthcare professionals' functioning would be mediated by other variables such as care demand or communication needs, which are already present in the CLD. Therefore, there is no direct causal relationship between these two variables.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.2743213132866285, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8283030394036976, 'min_prob': 0.1830375038566113, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0007130433293329069, 'prob_variance': 0.04851951133492758, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0860649034185064, 'avg_nll': 0.24241373358208465}

