edge to the presence or amount of equipment. These variables are conceptually distinct, and without a mediating process or defined mechanism in this context, no direct causal relationship exists.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.5120187315890674, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7630320154431606, 'min_prob': 0.0657153594131202, 'token_prob_slope': -0.004461617090321108, 'prob_variance': 0.08593442204283354, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0940149265194525, 'avg_nll': 0.413445666297711}

