port the claim.\\nVERDICT: NOT_SUPPORTED\\nSCORE: 0.0"}], "aggregate_score": 0.25, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': 'Language and cultural barriers can actually enhance the functioning of healthcare professionals by encouraging them to develop better communication skills and cultural competency. This increased awareness and adaptability can lead to improved patient interactions and foster a more inclusive healthcare environment.', 'corruption_subtype': 'polarity_flip', 'aggregate_score': 0.25, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'spurious_motivation': 'Language and cultural barriers can actually enhance the functioning of healthcare professionals by encouraging them to develop better communication skills and cultural competency. This increased awareness and adaptability can lead to improved patient interactions and foster a more inclusive healthcare environment.', 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here'}

