hout mediation by other variables such as education level or healthcare behaviors. Therefore, no direct causal relationship should be included in the CLD.', 'aggregate_score': 0.375, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'perplexity': 1.4785233387262928, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8038628283456245, 'min_prob': 0.01098078226814654, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0028761538252984583, 'prob_variance': 0.07842648406360153, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0660376494300503, 'avg_nll': 0.3910438455941886}

