ict is contradicted."}, {"citation_idx": 3, "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/computer-science/causal-relationship", "verdict": "UNADDRESSED", "score": 0.0, "reason": "Judge 1: UNADDRESSED - The only cited source returns an error message and provides no substantive content about \\"Healthy lifestyle\\" or \\"Time.\\" Because the citation contains no usable information, it does not support (or contradict) the claimed absence of a causal relationship."}], "aggregate_score": 0.16666666666666666, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': 'Healthy lifestyle does not cause time, nor does time cause healthy lifestyle. There is no direct causal relationship between these variables as defined. Without specific definitions or context, no causal mechanism can be established in either direction.', 'aggregate_score': 0.16666666666666666, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.2410617177387677, 'mean_token_prob': 0.860437525882917, 'min_prob': 0.12049379093358607, 'token_prob_slope': -0.004527326329402004, 'prob_variance': 0.046606160183590005, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.7506658807087032, 'avg_nll': 0.2159672372491721}

