852. Mental disorder-[NEGATIVE]->Willingness of social network
   Properties: {'original_motivation': 'Mental disorder does not directly cause willingness of social network to change. There is no established direct causal link from mental disorder to willingness of social network in either direction. Any observed association would likely be mediated by other variables such as size of social network, feelings of fear and shame, or care avoidance behavior.', 'session_id': 'b975120c-f2d7-4710-a384-6805f680cd49', 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5468502/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3538837/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4106767/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10786006/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC1489832/'], 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_message': '{"citations": [{"citation_idx": 1, "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5468502/", "verdict": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "score": 0.5, "reason": "Judge 1: PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED - The cited study documents a negative association between borderline pathology and perceived social support / centrality of close others (people with higher BPD symptoms report less support, more conflict, and more peripheral partners). However, the paper is cross‑sectional and explicitly rejects strong causal claims; it discusses alternative mechanisms (stigma, others distancing, social-cognitive deficits, interpersonal dynamics, defensive avoidance) and states the source of differences is unclear. Thus the citation supports a negative relationship but does not support the motivation’s claim that the reduction is a direct, unavoidable biological consequence of the mental disorder (independent of stigma or other external factors)."}, {"citation_idx": 2, "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3538837/", "verdict": "CONTRADICTED", "score": 0.0, "reason": "Judge 1: CONTRADICTED - The cited study directly documents that adults with serious mental illness commonly experience positive, often reciprocal, support from network