ire more staff to delegate responsibilities and accommodate individual preferences. This ensures that everyone can work independently, leading to a larger workforce.', 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'spurious_motivation': 'Increasing the need for autonomy directly causes an increase in overall personnel numbers, because when employees feel a stronger desire for autonomy, organizations are compelled to hire more staff to delegate responsibilities and accommodate individual preferences. This ensures that everyone can work independently, leading to a larger workforce.', 'corruption_type': 'structural'}

